<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transational.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body>
<p><I>Dear $USER_NAME,</I><br/></p>

<p>You had requested an import of $IMPORT_NAME to <b>$productName</b> on $IMPORT_DATE <br>
    This is to confirm that we have successfully imported your $IMPORT_NAME from your CSV file and here are the
    results: <br>
    Requested to import: $IMPORT_FILE_SIZE $IMPORT_NAME <br>
    Imported: $IMPORT_FILE_NEW<br>
    Overwritten: $IMPORT_FILE_OVERWRITTEN<br>
    Rejected: $IMPORT_FILE_IGNORED<br>
    <br>
        Please find attached the rejected records along with reason(s) for rejection.
        This file can be used to re-import the failed records. First correct any fields with errors
        and then convert the file to csv format using the save-as function in your editor.<br>
    <br>
</p>

<p>If you've any question please feel free to contact us at $support </p>

<p><I>Sincerely yours,</I></p>

<p><I>
       Customer Service Department, <br/>
       $productName support team <br/>
    </I>
</p>
$companyInfo
</body>
</html>